cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "Smoking, aging, and the gut microbiome — analysis code for Bao et al., NTR-2026-092"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for Bao et al. (NTR-2026-092), a secondary analysis of the
  Guangdong Gut Microbiome Project (GGMP) examining the joint relationship
  of smoking and aging with the gut microbiome and cardiometabolic risk
  profiles. Covers (a) the main-paper analyses producing Figures 1-6 and
  Supp Figs 1-5 (MaAsLin2 OTU-level smoking and age models, the LightGBM
  smoking classifier, GSEA-style chronic-disease enrichment, the ACC/AHA
  2013 PCE ASCVD computation, and the cardiometabolic mediation panel);
  and (b) the revision-period sensitivity / robustness analyses producing
  Supp Figs 6-11 and Supp Tables 9-21 (rarefaction supplement, male-only
  sensitivity, family- and genus-level OLS robustness, MaAsLin2 family /
  genus and male-only OTU cross-checks, ten-mediator cardiometabolic
  panel, and the Optuna-tuned LightGBM smoking classifier).
